ntent":"Quality + arrays"},"911":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-91","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"**The Agent strategy is the default.** You don't need to specify `--strategy agent` — it's used automatically when you run `struktur extract`."},"912":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-92","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"Autonomous extraction using a virtual filesystem. The agent decides when to read files, search for patterns, and build output incrementally."},"913":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-93","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Best For\" description=\"Most documents — adapts automatically\" />"},"914":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-94","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Virtual FS\" description=\"read, grep, find, ls, bash\" />"},"915":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-95","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Output Tools\" description=\"set_output_data, update_output_data\" />"},"916":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-96","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#agent-default","content":"<Card title=\"Model Requirement\" description=\"Must support tool calling\" />"},"917":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-97","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Document loaded** into virtual filesystem (`/artifacts/artifact.json`, `/artifacts/manifest.json`, `/artifacts/images/`)"},"918":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-98","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Agent explores** using tools: read files, grep for patterns, list directories, execute commands"},"919":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-99","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Incremental extraction** — calls `set_output_data` when first data found, `update_output_data` as more discovered"},"920":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-100","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Validation** — schema validation on every output update, with automatic retry on errors"},"921":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-101","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Completion** — agent calls `finish` when done, or `fail` if extraction impossible"},"922":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-102","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"The agent adapts to your document:"},"923":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-103","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Small documents** — reads everything at once"},"924":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-104","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Large documents** — navigates systematically, searching for relevant sections"},"925":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-105","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#how-it-works","content":"**Complex schemas** — builds output incrementally, validating as it goes"},"926":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-106","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#configuration","content":"<TypeTable\n  type=\"{\n  provider: {\n    description: 'Provider name (e.g., anthropic, openai)',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  modelId: {\n    description: 'Model identifier (e.g., claude-sonnet-4, gpt-4o)',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: true,\n  },\n  maxSteps: {\n    description: 'Maximum agent steps/turns',\n    type: 'number',\n    default: '50',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  apiKey: {\n    description: 'API key (or use env vars)',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  outputInstructions: {\n    description: 'Additional extraction guidance',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  systemPrompt: {\n    description: 'Override default system prompt',\n    type: 'string',\n    required: false,\n  },\n  prefill: {\n    description:\n      'Pre-load document context as synthetic read/view_image tool calls before the first step. `textTokens` caps the text, `maxImages` (default 1) and `maxImageBytes` (default 12 MB) cap images.',\n    type: '{ textTokens: number; maxImages?: number; maxImageBytes?: number }',\n    required: false,\n  },\n}\"\n/>"},"927":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-107","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#context-prefill","content":"The agent normally spends its first steps reading `/artifact.json` and looking at the image overview. Prefill hands it that context up front so it can extract immediately:"},"928":{"id":"/docs/explanation/strategies-108","page_id":"/docs/explanation/strategies","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/explanation/strategies#context-prefill","content":"The block is deterministic — stable tool-call ids, no timestamps — so the same document always produces the same prefix and providers can prompt-cache it. Images get far less budget than 